  "title": "Better than Zuppa Toscana Recipe",
  "description": "This better than zuppa Toscana recipe is a riff on the famous kale and sausage soup from Tuscany, Italy. Bacon gives this version a smoky flavor boost.",
  "authors": [
    "Jeanne Garber"
